{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Request flow: HTTP to a service over NATS",
  "description": "Follows POST /api/projects/:id/deployments from the router, through the gateway's handler and its client, to the fleet service.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/gateway/projects.go",
      "line": 43,
      "title": "The router",
      "description": "`app.Post(\"/api/projects/:id/deployments\"` maps the route to startDeployment. The HTTP layer is a driving adapter."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/gateway/deployments.go",
      "line": 21,
      "title": "The driving adapter",
      "description": "`func (a *Server) startDeployment` reads the body, checks the project.deploy policy, and calls the fleet service through the gateway's Fleet interface."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/gateway/fleetclient/client.go",
      "line": 117,
      "title": "The gateway's fleet client",
      "description": "`func (c *Client) CreateDeployment`. The gateway asks the fleet service over NATS and turns its refusals back into the errors the handlers match."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/fleet/deployments.go",
      "line": 218,
      "title": "The fleet service checks the build",
      "description": "`func (s *Service) queue`. It asks the builds service for the Build and its Check over NATS, checks the Agent, and only then records the Deployment."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/fleet/service.go",
      "line": 54,
      "title": "The Agent link the service needs",
      "description": "`type AgentLink interface`. The fleet service sends commands to Agents through it. Real: agentnats.Link, over the hub's NATS server. Test: agentlinktest.Loopback."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/fleet/store.go",
      "line": 250,
      "title": "The SQLite store",
      "description": "`func (s *Service) insertDeployment`. Stores the queued Deployment in fleet.db, refusing a second one in flight for the Project in the same transaction."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/domain/deployments/deployments.go",
      "line": 40,
      "title": "A domain rule",
      "description": "`func CanMove` is the legal-moves rule. Adapters call it rather than reimplementing it."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/services/gateway/audit.go",
      "line": 11,
      "title": "The Audit interface",
      "description": "`type auditRecorder interface` records Audit Events. Recording never fails the caller, so the handler does not handle its errors."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/cmd/janus/services.go",
      "line": 539,
      "title": "The composition root starts the fleet",
      "description": "`func (a *application) startFleet`. It joins the control plane to the tailnet, starts the fleet service, and gives the gateway its client."
    }
  ]
}
